&lt;p&gt;We collect and share book notes, key takeaways, mental models, and memorable passages — so insights from great books stay useful and discoverable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anyone can contribute. The goal is simple: make reading more cumulative and less ephemeral.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>